 "A radio station in Mombasa runs its Swahili interviews through Whisper. The audio is cut into thirty-second windows.": "e776b833c4.mp3",
 "Tokens at the start of the decoder's prompt choose the language and the task. Swahili, transcribe.": "7d2e177499.mp3",
 "Change one token to translate, and the same model writes English.": "b3efdbc717.mp3",
 "Force the language token to English, and Swahili comes out as English-sounding nonsense.": "916c5bd08d.mp3",
 "Without a voice activity gate, the station jingle becomes \"asante kwa kusikiliza\", thanks for listening. Nobody said it.": "a4cf31141c.mp3",
